Formula-style 2022 open-wheeler

Original mesh for this repository. Geometry follows public FIA Formula 1
Technical Regulations from the 2022+ ground-effect era (full-width front
wing, venturi floor, diffuser, beam wing, 18-inch wheels). It is not a
team car, has no livery, and is not affiliated with Formula 1.

Dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
